    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be as straight or as wavy as you want, just do not let your opponents win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lines, up to 4 players compete to see who can stay alive for the longest time. Use power-ups to increase your odds or break from enemy trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Import your own maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your own maps in any external editor, save as .png and import them into the game. Select colors your lines will not collide with, starting positions and play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be as straight or as wavy as you want, just do not let your opponents win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lines, up to 4 players compete to see who can stay alive for the longest time. Use power-ups to increase your odds or break from enemy trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Import your own maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your own maps in any external editor, save as .png and import them into the game. Select colors your lines will not collide with, starting positions and play.</p>",
    "short_description": "Play against your family and friends and see who can survive the longest in this snake-like game. Use power-ups to your advantage and try to outrun your opponents. Up to 4 players in hot seat mode. Draw you own maps in any external program, import into the game and enjoy!\u00a0",
